{"timestamp": "2026-04-28T06:56:57.706109", "query": "baby bottle accept nahi kar raha kya karein", "reply": "Baby ko bottle accept karne ke liye aapko kuch tips try karni chahiye. Pehle to aap bottle ko garam pani se wash karke saaf karein, phir usmein thoda breast milk ya formula milk daalein. Baby ko bottle ko choosne ke liye kahein, aur agar wo refuse karta hai to aap usko finger feeding try kar sakte hain. Iske alawa, aap baby ko bottle ko hold karne ke liye bhi kahein, taaki wo usko apne haathon se pakde. Agar phir bhi baby bottle accept nahi karta hai to aap doctor se consult karein, wo aapko aur bhi tips de sakte hain.", "mode": "data", "score": 0.684, "response_time_ms": 3004.18}
{"timestamp": "2026-04-28T06:57:05.745975", "query": "when should I introduce cow milk", "reply": "It's recommended to introduce cow's milk to your baby after they have crossed 1 year of age. Introducing cow's milk before 1 year can increase the risk of allergies and digestive issues. If you're looking for an alternative, you can consider breast milk or formula until your baby is at least 12 months old. Would you like to know more about introducing cow's milk or other dairy products to your baby's diet?", "mode": "data", "score": 0.769, "response_time_ms": 1745.43}
{"timestamp": "2026-04-28T06:57:13.098390", "query": "what supplements should breastfeeding mother take after c section", "reply": "As a breastfeeding mother after a C-section, it's essential to take supplements to support your health and milk production. You should consider taking Vitamin B complex, Vitamin C, iron, and calcium for 1-3 months. Additionally, you can take 2-3 capsules of clo (likely referring to a lactation support supplement) per day and 2 tablets of Newrobion (a vitamin supplement) per day. It's also crucial to supplement with iron, calcium, and Vitamin D3. Furthermore, maintaining a high protein diet and staying hydrated by drinking plenty of water can help support your overall health and milk production. \n\nCan you please tell me what your current diet and hydration routine look like, and if you have any other concerns regarding your milk production or overall health?", "mode": "data", "score": 0.868, "response_time_ms": 2227.29}
{"timestamp": "2026-04-28T06:57:20.076505", "query": "can I give dry fruits to 8 month old baby", "reply": "For an 8-month-old baby, you can start introducing dry fruits in a powdered form. It's recommended to roast the dry fruits with water or milk before powdering them to make them easier to digest. You can start with small amounts, such as 1-2 teaspoons, and mix them with their regular purees. Some good options to begin with are almonds, walnuts, and dates. However, please ensure that the powdered dry fruits are finely ground to avoid any choking hazards. Would you like to know more about the specific dry fruits that are suitable for an 8-month-old baby?", "mode": "data", "score": 0.844, "response_time_ms": 1876.38}
{"timestamp": "2026-04-28T06:57:28.273489", "query": "breastfeeding se weight loss hoti hai kya", "reply": "Breastfeeding se weight loss hota hai, lekin yeh sabse zaroori baat hai ki aapko apne diet par dhyan dena hoga. Agar aap breastfeeding kar rahe hain toh aapko extra calories ki zaroorat hoti hai, taaki aapka baby acchi tarah se grow kar sake. Lekin agar aap apne diet par dhyan dete hain aur healthy food khate hain, toh breastfeeding se weight loss bhi ho sakta hai. Aap apne doctor se consult karein aur unse apne diet ke bare mein puchhein.", "mode": "data", "score": 0.707, "response_time_ms": 2038.66}
{"timestamp": "2026-04-28T06:57:34.933904", "query": "baby ki dry skin pe kya lagayein", "reply": "Baby ki dry skin pe aap coconut oil ya olive oil lagaa sakte hain. In oils mein moisturizing properties hoti hain jo baby ki dry skin ko soothe kar sakti hain. Aap warm water se bath karne ke baad oil lagaa sakte hain, taaki skin absorb kar sake. Agar skin bahut dry hai to aap baby lotion bhi use kar sakte hain.", "mode": "data", "score": 0.653, "response_time_ms": 1707.17}
