{"timestamp": "2026-04-28T06:57:49.786691", "query": "kitne ghante tak doodh bahar rakh sakte hain", "reply": "Doodh ko bahar rakhne ke liye samay seema 4-6 ghante hai, lekin yeh nirbhar karta hai ki aapne doodh ko kis tareeke se store kiya hai. Agar aapne doodh ko fridge mein rakha hai, to yeh 4-6 ghante tak safe rahega. Lekin agar aapne doodh ko room temperature par rakha hai, to yeh 1-2 ghante tak hi safe rahega. Isliye, aapko doodh ko jaldi se jaldi fridge mein rakhna chahiye ya phir use jaldi se jaldi use karna chahiye.", "mode": "data", "score": 0.801, "response_time_ms": 1963.33}
{"timestamp": "2026-04-28T06:57:57.960758", "query": "breast mein doodh kam aa raha hai kaise badhayein", "reply": "Aapki samasya samajh mein aayi. Breast mein doodh badhane ke liye aapko regular feeding ya pumping karna hoga. Agar aapko lagta hai ki aapka baby poora doodh nahi pi raha hai, toh aapko thoda sa extra pumping karna chahiye. Iske alawa, aapko hydrated rehna hoga, aur achhi diet leni hogi. Aapko har 2-3 ghante mein feeding ya pumping karna chahiye, aur agar aapko lagta hai ki aapka doodh abhi bhi kam aa raha hai, toh aap lactation consultant se salah le sakte hain.", "mode": "data", "score": 0.833, "response_time_ms": 1926.6}
